---
import WikiLayout from '../layouts/WikiLayout.astro';
---

<WikiLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy and advertising disclosure for the Idle Guild Master Plus Community Wiki."
>
  <article class="privacyPage">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        IGM+ Wiki is an independent, fan-maintained community wiki for the Idle Guild Master Plus mod.
        We do not require user accounts and do not directly collect personal information such as your
        name, email address, or payment details.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses <strong>Vercel Web Analytics</strong> to measure anonymous pageviews and
        general traffic patterns so we can improve wiki content and performance.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Third-Party Advertising</h2>
      <p>
        To help cover domain and maintenance costs, this wiki displays non-intrusive banner
        advertisements provided by third-party ad networks (such as Adsterra and, in the future,
        Google AdSense). These third-party providers may use cookies, web beacons, or similar
        technologies to serve and measure ads.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings at any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Unofficial Fan Wiki Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        This website is an unofficial community resource and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
        sponsored by the original developers of <em>Idle Guild Master</em>. All original game assets
        and trademarks belong to their respective owners.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</WikiLayout>

<style>
  .privacyPage {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .privacyPage h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .privacyPage section {
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .privacyPage h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--text-gold);
  }

  .privacyPage p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
